{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109160","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510916001:0":{"text":"So... you came after all...","source_cn":"你们，还是来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCD7C2CE6CD0C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510916002:0":{"text":"And here I thought you'd welcome the help, not bleed all over us.","source_cn":"大英雄，现在可不是你逞能的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842ED2CF5C188A9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510916003:0":{"text":"How bad is it? Can you stand?","source_cn":"你的伤势怎么样？还坚持得住吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5473E34424D8C683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510916004:0":{"text":"It's nothing... I've had worse...","source_cn":"不要紧，我受过更多比这更重的伤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAD0FDEE1BD2FE35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510916005:0":{"text":"We must... must find a way to hold off the Wildborn's attack. Only then will the Halian soldiers have a chance to escape...","source_cn":"必须……必须想办法抗住雅库伯尔的进攻，呼临士兵才有逃命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE077C0F5FA172CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var